$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: GENERAL PROCEDURE F: Suzuki A mixture of 72
(1.0 equiv), boronic acid (1.1 equiv),
tetrakis(trophenylphosphine)palladium (0) (0.08 equiv) and potassium
carbonate (2 equiv) in dimethoxyethane/water (10:1, 0.1M) was stirred at
110 °C for 1h under microwave in a sealed tube. The reaction was quenched
with a saturated solution of NaHCO3. The aqueous layer was extracted with
EtOAc. The combined organic layers were dried over anhydrous MgSO4,
filtered and concentrated in vacuo. The purification by silica gel
chromatography of the crude mixture yielded the expected compound.
2-(5-(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)thiophen-2-yl)-1-methyl-3-phenyl-2,3-dihydroquinazolin-4(1H)-one
(76) The title compound was prepared following the general protocol F
using 72 (70 mg, 0.175 mmol), 3,4-dimethoxyphenylboronic acid (35 mg,
0.192 mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (16 mg, 0.014 mmol) and potassium carbonate (48
mg, 0.374 mmol). The purification of the crude mixture by silica gel
chromatography (EtOAc/heptane 5/5) yielded the title compound
2-(5-(benzo[b]thiophen-3-yl)thiophen-2-yl)-1-methyl-3-phenyl-2,3-dihydroquinazolin-4(1H)-one
(85) The title compound was prepared following the general protocol F
using 72 (100 mg, 0.250 mmol), thionaphthene-3-boronic acid (49 mg, 0.275
mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (23 mg, 0.020 mmol) and potassium carbonate (69 mg,
0.500 mmol). The purification of the crude mixture by silica gel
chromatography (EtOAc/heptane 4/6) yielded the title compound (67 mg,
59%), pale brown solid. 1H-NMR (400MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) = 3.03 (s, 3H),
6.05 (s, 1H), 6.71 (d, J= 8.1 Hz, 1H), 6.92 (d, J = 3.7 Hz, 1H), 6.98(t,
J= 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.09 (d, J= 3.7 Hz, 1H), 7.29-7.48 (m, 9H), 7.84-7.88 (m,
1H), 7.98-8.02 (m, 1H), 8.15 (dd, J= 7.8 Hz, J’ = 1.6 Hz, 1H) 13C-NMR
(100MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) = 36.5, 78.1, 113.3, 117.8, 119.6, 122.9, 123.0,
124.1, 124.6, 124.8, 124.8, 126.8, 127.3, 127.4, 129.3, 129.9, 134.4,
136.9, 137.9, 139.0, 140.5, 140.6, 146.4, 162.0 MS (ESI) [M+H]+ = 452.9
LC/MS (XBridge 100 × 4.6 mm) : tR = 9.32 min, m/z : 452.9 ([M+H+])
Gradient A : tR = 24.95 min Gradient D : tR = 22.35 min I.R. (neat, cm-1)
3067, 2954, 2886, 1657, 1605, 1494, 750, 694 HRMS m/z [(M+H)+] calcd for
C27H21N2OS2 453.1107 found 453.1095.
