$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2-Amino-5-(furan-2-yl)-4-methoxy-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2-amino- 5-iodo-4-methoxy-7-(βH-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2829
(822 mg, 2 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (336 mg, 3 mmol), Na2CO3 (636 mg,
6 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (22 mg, 98 μmol), and TPPTS (142 mg, 0.25 mmol) in
water/MeCN (2:1, 10 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the
mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and evaporated to dryness in
vacuo, and the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100%
MeOH in water). Repurification by column chromatography (SiO2, 2.5% MeOH
in chloroform) furnished 10a which was crystallized from MeOH.
2-Amino-4-methoxy-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-3-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (10d).
Compound 10d was prepared as described for 10a from 28 (844 mg, 2 mmol)
and thiophene-3-boronic acid as a yellowish solid (443 mg, 58%), which
was crystallized from water/MeOH. Mp 206-208 °C. [α ]D -57.3 (c 0.279,
DMSO). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.52 (bdm, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, H-5´a);
3.61 (bdm, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, H-5´b); 3.84 (td, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b
= 4.3 Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 3.3 Hz, H-4´); 3.97 (s, 3H, CH3O); 4.08 (m, 1H,
H-3'); 4.35 (bq, 1H, J2´ ,1´ = J2´,OH = J2´ ,3´ = 5.6 Hz, H-2'); 5.03 (m,
1H, OH-5´); 5.07 (m, 1H, OH-3´); 5.27 (bd, 1H, JOH,2´ = 6.3 Hz, OH-2´);
6.03 (d, 1H, J1´ ,2´ = 6.4 Hz, H-1'); 6.30 (s, 2H, NH2); 7.46 (dd, 1H,
J4,5 = 5.0 Hz, J4,2 = 1.3 Hz, H-4-thienyl); 7.47 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.52 (dd,
1H, J5,4 = 5.0 Hz, J5,2 = 3.0 Hz, H-5-thienyl); 7.75 (dd, 1H, J2,5 = 2.9
Hz, J2,4 = 1.3 Hz, H-2-thienyl). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 53.20
(CH3O); 61.87 (CH2-5´); 70.70 (CH-3'); 73.50 (CH-2'); 84.80 (CH-4´);
85.96 (CH-1´); 95.16 (C-4a); 112.08 (C-5); 118.09 (CH-6); 120.32
(CH-2-thienyl); 125.51 (CH-5- thienyl); 127.85 (CH-4-thienyl); 135.06
(C-3-thienyl); 155.72 (C-7a); 159.56 (C-2); 163.37 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν
1609, 1578, 1442 1390, 1307, 1295, 1144, 1044, 982, 849, 788, 754, 692,
612 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 379 (M+H), 401 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C16H19N4O5S
[M+H] calcd: 379.10707; found: 379.10706. Anal. (C16H18N4O5S•¼H2O): C, H,
N.
