$DATUM N-(6-(4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)benzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide
27 2 A mixture of N-(6-bromobenzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide 26 (5 g, 18.4
mmol), bis(pinacolato)diboron (9.34 g, 36.8 mmol), KOAc (9.34 g, 95.2
mmol) and PdCl2(dppf) (1.5 g, 2.05 mmol) in DMF (100 mL) was stirred at
105 ºC for 36 h. Concentration in vacuo gave a residue to which a mixture
of ether/EtOAc (4:3, 700 mL) was added. The solution was washed with
water (4 x 100 mL) and dried. Evaporation of solvents and trituration
with ether/hexanes (1:1).
N-(6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)benzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)acetamide
27 (3.13 g, 53%) as a solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 10.83 (s, 1H),
8.33 (s, 1H), 7.92–7.89 (m, 1H), 7.77 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H), 2.30 (s, 3H),
1.39 (s, 12H); ESMS m/z 319.12 (M+ + 1).
